## Recommended Build Flags (Main App)

| Flag                  | Purpose                                          |
|-----------------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| `__DEV__`             | Development mode (not production)                |
| `__PROD__`            | Production build                                 |
| `__CI__`              | CI environment (e.g. GitHub Actions)             |
| `__LOGGING_ENABLED__` | Enable verbose logging (dev, not CI/prod)        |

---

## Summary

| Mechanism      | Purpose                                      |
|----------------|----------------------------------------------|
| `define`       | Build-time flags (`__DEV__`, `__CI__`, etc.) |
| `log-config`   | Cloudflare runtime: `ENVIRONMENT`, `TEST_MODE`|
| Module flags   | Per-module verbosity (`LOG_DECK`, etc.)      |
| Alias + stub   | Optional: replace logging-domain in prod     |
| Vitest setup   | CI: suppress `console.*`                     |

